# Allowlist: aaarora/dmm is a public image, and a local build runs against the
# working tree, where gitignored files (dmm.cfg, dmm.db, logs, env/, kubeconfigs)
# would otherwise be copied in by the Dockerfile's `COPY .`. Only what the
# build (pip install /opt/dmm/) and the entrypoint need goes in.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src
!docker

**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
**/*.log
